{{also|Anders|änders|ånders|ænders}}
==Dutch==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|anders}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|nl|/ˈɑn.dərs/}}
* {{audio|nl|Nl-anders.ogg|Audio}}
* {{hyphenation|nl|an|ders}}
* {{rhyme|nl|ɑndərs}}

===Adjective===
{{head|nl|adjective form}}

# {{nl-adj form of|pred|ander}}
#: {{ux|nl|De situatie is '''anders''' dan vorig jaar.|t=The situation is '''different''' from last year.|inline=1}}
# {{nl-adj form of|part|ander}}
#: {{ux|nl|Vandaag wil ik iets '''anders''' doen.|t=Today I want to do something '''different'''.|inline=1}}

===Adverb===
{{nl-adv}}

# [[otherwise]]
#: {{ux|nl|Ik moet me haasten, '''anders''' zal ik te laat komen.|t=I must hurry, '''otherwise''' I will come too late.|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|nl|Hij is er vandaag vroeger dan '''anders'''.|Today he's earlier than [he] '''otherwise''' [would've been].|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|nl|Het loopt vandaag anders dan '''anders'''.|Today things go differently than [how they] '''otherwise''' [go].|inline=1}}
# [[differently]]
#: {{ux|nl|Je had je '''anders''' moeten gedragen.|You should have behaved '''differently'''.|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|nl|Het loopt vandaag '''anders''' dan anders.|Today things go '''differently''' than [how they] otherwise [go].|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|nl|De volgende keer doe ik het '''anders'''.|t=The next time I will do it '''differently'''.|inline=1}}

